        "body": "<i>Imported from JIRA <a href=\"https://jira.lyrasis.org/browse/DS-2081\">[DS-2081]</a> created by pbecker</i>\n<p>EPersons currently cannot be deleted in DSpace if they commited Items or took a task out of a workflow pool. This constraint should be overcome as g.e. the submitter is stored in an item's metadata in the provenance field as well.</p>\n\n<p>This was discussed on dspace-devel <span class=\"error\">&#91;1&#93;</span> and in a developer meeting <span class=\"error\">&#91;2&#93;</span>.</p>\n\n<p><span class=\"error\">&#91;1&#93;</span> <a href=\"http://dspace.2283337.n4.nabble.com/Deletion-of-EPersons-with-submitted-Item-td4673220.html\" class=\"external-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">http://dspace.2283337.n4.nabble.com/Deletion-of-EPersons-with-submitted-Item-td4673220.html</a><br/>\n<span class=\"error\">&#91;2&#93;</span> <a href=\"http://irclogs.duraspace.org/index.php?date=2014-06-04\" class=\"external-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">http://irclogs.duraspace.org/index.php?date=2014-06-04</a></p>",
